1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:07,500
Vessels are short, wide tubes stacked end to end, with their end walls perforated or dissolved away.

2
00:00:07,500 --> 00:00:13,710
Together they make one continuous open pipe, the most efficient water conductor there is.

3
00:00:13,710 --> 00:00:16,731
They are characteristic of flowering plants.

